  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "miniature adventure",
  "premise": "A tiny astronomer wants to chart a pretend night sky inside an open umbrella, but each attempt to climb shifts the canopy and hides another star sticker. They lie flat in a suspended paper hammock between two ribs and finally see the full constellation, which outlines their missing hat.",
